{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a streamer, chasing hype and new followers, heading into an abandoned building.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/f0871256d34b6ef7fbc8637e27da53c3.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/f0871256d34b6ef7fbc8637e27da53c3.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/f0871256d34b6ef7fbc8637e27da53c3.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> The camera is on. Viewers in the chat laugh, tease, and wait for screams. But what started as a fun stream from a &quot;scary place&quot; quickly turns into something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/141cf59d3a8eb3efedbad0a296c970b5.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/141cf59d3a8eb3efedbad0a296c970b5.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/141cf59d3a8eb3efedbad0a296c970b5.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every minute, you sink deeper \u2014 into someone else\u2019s game. Someone is watching. Someone was waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifelike \u0441hat simulation.\u00a0Donations provide hints or lead you astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and use deduction to move forward.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/1206c2e24357f160a10ec13509a08343.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/1206c2e24357f160a10ec13509a08343.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/1206c2e24357f160a10ec13509a08343.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/de03fea0f62f3fdb4061e5f34b10fdc8.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/de03fea0f62f3fdb4061e5f34b10fdc8.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/de03fea0f62f3fdb4061e5f34b10fdc8.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment and find key items.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/d24c3d3060ef87823c8ba8c05b703156.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/d24c3d3060ef87823c8ba8c05b703156.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/d24c3d3060ef87823c8ba8c05b703156.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/ba39f50d531084f0bb8169ccbc8603b6.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/ba39f50d531084f0bb8169ccbc8603b6.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/ba39f50d531084f0bb8169ccbc8603b6.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into the story and try to understand what\u2019s really happening.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/f3a15704f9b8f238343bcdceaf5e14f6.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/f3a15704f9b8f238343bcdceaf5e14f6.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/f3a15704f9b8f238343bcdceaf5e14f6.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Graphics and Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features highly realistic graphics.<br>An unsettling and oppressive atmosphere creates a constant sense of tension and uncertainty.<br>3D spatial audio enhances the immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/55b22530ca42f7ff00d2004e6f61343e.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/55b22530ca42f7ff00d2004e6f61343e.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/55b22530ca42f7ff00d2004e6f61343e.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920890?t=1761336886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/43356aa45bf311c36221111d4e865d3fc2a56131/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761336886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/a73ffeba1e86be308e90