k deeper \u2014 into someone else\u2019s game. Someone is watching. Someone was waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/7658be34ef9be18493c2d4c0a8a2a88b.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifelike \u0441hat simulation.\u00a0Donations provide hints or lead you astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.webm?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/821603dac126883cc817074ea6fb56ad.mp4?t=1761336886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and use deduction to move forward.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920890/extras/1206c2e24357f160a10ec13509a08343.poster.avif?t=1761336886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset